file caravan/abate.rye one of sixteen rungs whose twenty-eight-line body became a three-line stub
file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_carry_scan.sh ceiling lowered to meet the measured carry
file tools/caravan_ladder_carry_witness.rish repinned to the new carry and the arithmetic the lap settled
file tools/caravan_ladder_reach_visibility_witness.rish folded row and the four plateau rows repinned and asserted
recommend keep-going bearing_note leads by fall at 342 over thirty-nine rungs widening nothing, with appraisal_note at 333 and recant_note at 324 behind it in the same twelve-line shape -- so the next several laps choose among near-identical products, and the lap that takes bearing_note tests the product rule from the breadth end where found_path tested it from the depth end
